# SOC 2 readiness binder

Generated by `soc2-readiness-pack`. **We cannot self-certify, but we can
model the auditor's process and results exactly.** Every document below
tracks real, cited, regenerable state — never a compliance verdict. See
`gates/010_no_compliance_verdict.rq`: it structurally refuses any fact in
this binder's source graph claiming compliance, certification, or a
rendered auditor opinion.

